Package: reims-vgpu
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ReimsOS Team <dev@reims-os.org>
Depends: reims-core (>= 0.1.0), libvulkan1, libglib2.0-0, libpixman-1-0, libslirp0
Description: Accelerated macOS virtual GPU for QEMU and reims-ctl utility
 Contains the patched qemu-system-x86_64 build with metal2vulkan acceleration,
 along with reims-ctl and reims-util for automated macOS VM provisioning.
